{
  "note": "⌨️ Language-neutral corpus for the two window-scope decisions the React shell and the wgpu shell must both make: which window a seeded mode layout opens active (dockSeedActiveWindowIdV1 / dock_seed_active_window_id_v1) and which window an app-wide chord addresses (resolveKeybindingTargetWindowV1 / resolve_keybinding_target_window_v1). The generation3d rows are the real editor declaration: addGeneration is owned by the Generations window alone while mod+shift+g is app-wide, and the generate layout is the 22/43/35 row the named layout seeds.",
